  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Merchandise that carries a University logo or trademark must be purchased from vendors that are licensed through the Collegiate Licensing Corporation. Therefore, bidders are required to be currently licensed to carry the University of Arkansas logo or in order to be eligible to submit bids for those requests that involve the University of Arkansas logo or trademark. Only those offers submitted by currently licensed bidders will be considered for award.</p>
